\f0\b\fs28 \cf2 Session Duration Budget & Capacity Matrices\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 Session set capacity is constrained by the athlete's explicit Session Duration Budget ($T_\{budget\}$). The duration required for a session ($T_\{total\}$) is calculated using warm-up allocations, set execution times, rest intervals, and exercise transition times:\
$$T_\{total\} = T_\{warmup\} + \\sum_\{i=1\}^\{E\} \\left( N_\{sets, i\} \\cdot T_\{exec\} + (N_\{sets, i\} - 1) \\cdot T_\{rest, i\} \\right) + (E - 1) \\cdot T_\{trans\}$$\
Where:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 $T_\{warmup\} = 5.0\\text\{ minutes\}$ (general warm-up baseline).\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 $T_\{exec\} = 0.75\\text\{ minutes\}$ ($45\\text\{ seconds\}$ total time-under-tension per set).\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 $T_\{rest, i\} = 2.0\\text\{ minutes\}$ for primary compound slots; $1.25\\text\{ minutes\}$ for secondary isolation slots.\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 $T_\{trans\} = 2.0\\text\{ minutes\}$ (setup and movement transition time between distinct exercises $E$).\

