\fs28 \cf2 Thin Session Diagnostic Criteria\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 The LLM Coach monitors session quality using deterministic diagnostic conditions. A session is flagged as "thin" if any of the following parameters are satisfied:\
$$\\text\{ThinSession\} = \\begin\{cases\} \\text\{TRUE\} & \\text\{if \} N_\{sets\} < 10 \\text\{ AND \} T_\{budget\} \\ge 60\\text\{ min\} \\\\ \\text\{TRUE\} & \\text\{if \} E_\{count\} < 4 \\text\{ AND \} T_\{budget\} \\ge 60\\text\{ min\} \\\\ \\text\{TRUE\} & \\text\{if Mandatory Primary Slot is Unfilled\} \\\\ \\text\{FALSE\} & \\text\{otherwise\} \\end\{cases\}$$\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

